GCC 16 gfortran respects the module-level 'private' access specifier for bind(C)
procedures, causing the C API symbols to be marked HIDDEN in the object file and
not exported from the shared library. Make the bind(C) procedures public.

--- a/src/dftbp/api/mm/capi.F90
+++ b/src/dftbp/api/mm/capi.F90
@@ -19,7 +19,7 @@
   use dftbp_mmapi, only : TDftbPlus, TDftbPlus_destruct, TDftbPlus_init, TDftbPlusAtomList,&
       & TDftbPlusInput
   implicit none
-  private
+  public
 
 
